# Ticket #1 – User Locked Out of Domain Account

## Issue Summary
User unable to log into domain-joined workstation (PC1).  
System message indicated account lockout.

## Triage Process
1. Replicated issue at login screen.
2. Verified lockout status in Active Directory Users and Computers (ADUC).
3. Confirmed multiple failed login attempts triggered lockout.

## Root Cause
Account lockout caused by repeated incorrect password attempts.

## Resolution
1. Accessed ADUC on DC1.
2. Navigated to user object (J.Smith).
3. Unlocked account under Account tab.
4. Verified successful login to PC1.

## Validation
User authenticated successfully after unlock.

