# Ticket #2 – No Internet Connectivity

## Issue Summary
User reported inability to access external websites.  
Domain login functioning normally.

## Initial Symptoms
- `ping google.com` failed.
- `ping 192.168.100.10` (Domain Controller) succeeded.

## Triage Process
1. Verified internal domain connectivity.
2. Checked IP configuration using: 
- ipconfig

3. Observed missing 10.0.2.x NAT address.

## Root Cause
Internet-facing network adapter (NAT) was disabled.

## Resolution
1. Opened Network Connections.
2. Identified disabled NAT adapter.
3. Re-enabled adapter.
4. Verified internet access using:
-ping google.com

## Validation
External connectivity restored successfully.

